## Title: Player role indicator
## Description: A simple addon that adds role indicators above grouped players and notifies grouped player deaths + resurrections.
## Author: Parietic, Glande-Pas
## APIVersion: 101051
## AddOnVersion: 141
## Version: 1.4.1.32
## DependsOn: LibAddonMenu-2.0>=43 LibCustomMenu>=730
## SavedVariables: PlayerRoleIndicatorVars

Menu.lua
Main.lua
PlayerRoleIndicator.xml

##Change log:
##Version 1.4.1:
##- Fix isDead typo showing resurrect notification on death, caught by GStheMighty
##
##Version 1.4.0:
##- Rewrote Icon placement using native 3D render-space API to improve performance
##- Icons and notifications created on demand (control pool) to lighten load time work
##- Reduced polling: role, death and debuff state now event-driven and cached
##- Added new option to see the icons scale down with distance
##- Public API: `PlayerRoleIndicator.GetRole(unitTag)`
##	- Returns a snapshot table describing the role currently assigned/displayed for unitTag:
##    `{ name, show, showOnAlive, icon = { texturePath, iconSizeMultiplier, colourAlive, colourDead } }`
##	- icon.texturePath/iconSizeMultiplier/colourAlive/colourDead describe the icon this addon would draw for that role.
##	- The 'sv' field on the returned table is a deprecated alias for 'icon'; use 'icon' going forward.
##
##Version 1.3.2:
##- Bugfix: Reducing globals pollution should not cause crashing
##
##Version 1.3.1:
##- Public API: `PlayerRoleIndicator.AddCustomRoleMenuItems(accountName, addItemFunc, onChangedFunc)`
##	- Allows other addons to inject custom role "Add to / Remove from" items into any right-click menu.
##	- accountName: the player's @AccountName (as returned by `GetUnitDisplayName()`).
##	- `addItemFunc(label, callback)`: function used to add each menu item; defaults to AddMenuItem.
##	  Pass AddCustomMenuItem (LibCustomMenu) for context menus built with that library.
##	- onChangedFunc(): optional callback invoked after each role assignment change.
##- Public API: `PlayerRoleIndicator.EVENT.CUSTOM_ROLE_CHANGED`
##	- CALLBACK_MANAGER event string fired whenever custom role assignments change.
##	- Subscribe with: `CALLBACK_MANAGER:RegisterCallback(PlayerRoleIndicator.EVENT.CUSTOM_ROLE_CHANGED, func)`
##	- Fired in addition to the onChangedFunc parameter of AddCustomRoleMenuItems.
##	- Signature: `func(accountName)`
##	  - accountName: the @AccountName of the affected player, or nil when a bulk
##	    change was made through the settings panel (e.g. "Clear players", "Forget deleted roles").
##- Avoid requiring reload UI on settings changes
##- Allow tweaking icon sizes individually
##
##Version 1.3.0:
##- Update menu hooks to stop causing bugs with new APIs (double entries, preventing vote to kick)
##- Make vCR Shadow of the fallen mech work on all locales
##- Massively increase available icons for custom roles
##
##Version 1.2.1:
##- Using new API function `GetUnitRawWorldPosition(string unitTag)`, should fix addon not working in some areas
##
##Version 1.2.0:
##- New dependency, LibCustomMenu.
##- Global colours for resurrection pending and resurrection in progress.
##- Each role can have different colours for alive and dead players.
##- Added notifications.
##	- Colour, show dead/resection and icon used come from settings of each respective role.
##	- Duration, location and size can be customized.
##	- Notifications can be turned off.
##- Added custom roles.
##	- Name can be customized.
##	- Has same setting options as other roles.
##	- To add players to said custom role you can right click players in the group menu.
##	- Priority of roles goes Custom role (Top most custom role will have priority) > Leader > LFG role
##- Minor bug fixes
##
##Version 1.1.6:
##- Minor bug fixes.
##
##Version 1.1.5:
##- Major improvements to icon positioning. Different FOV/Resolution/UI scaling/Aspect ratio should no longer cause issues.
##
##Version 1.1.4:
##- Minor bug fixes.
##
##Version 1.1.3:
##- Minor bug fixes.
##
##Version 1.1.2:
##- Possible fix for different UI scaling.
##- Cleaned up source code and improved performance.
##
##Version 1.1.1:
##- Now when a player has died in vCR while fighting Z'Maja the icon will change colour indicating if their shade is alive or not.
##- Colour for Shadow of the Fallen is customizable.
##- You can toggle for Shadow of the Fallen indication on or off in the addon menu.
##- Minor bug fixes and tweaks.
##
##Version 1.1.0:
##- Cleaned up source code.
##- Max group size increased to 24 for larger groups.
##- You can now change the colour of icons for each role.
##- You now have a selection of icons to use for each role.
##- Possible fix for icon drift as they get closer to the edge of the screen (Need testing on other resolutions).
##- If icons are set to only show above dead players the icon will not appear if the payer is being resurrected or has resurrection pending.
##
##Version 1.0.2:
##- Minor bug fix.
